{"ref":"BDB, חֹ֫פֶן","hw":"חֹ֫פֶן","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֹ֫פֶן</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>hollow of hand (</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹפֶן</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּפְנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܽܘܦܢܳܐ</span>; Ethiopic ሕፍን: —also Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حُفْنَةٌ</span> <em>hollow in the ground;</em> and, according to Zehnpfund <sup>BAS i, 635</sup>, Assyrian <em>ḫupunnu</em>, <em>bowl</em>, but <em>ḫ</em> = ح ?<strong>)</strong>—only du. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.6\">Ec 4:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.7\">Ez 10:7</a> (del. Co intern. grounds); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.2\">Ez 10:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">Lv 16:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.4\">Pr 30:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפְנֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:8\" href=\"/Exodus.9.8\">Ex 9:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלֵּא ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.2\">Ez 10:2</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.7\">7</a> (del. Co cf. supr.);—<span dir=\"rtl\">מְלֹא ח׳</span> = <em>handful</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:8\" href=\"/Exodus.9.8\">Ex 9:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">Lv 16:12</a> (both P), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.6\">Ec 4:6</a>, material follows in implic. acc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">מי־אסף רוח בח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.4\">Pr 30:4</a>.","next":"BDB, חָפְנִי","prev":"BDB, חפן"}